<title>SLOVENIA: Slovenia August inflation slows to 10.3 pct.</title>
<headline>Slovenia August inflation slows to 10.3 pct.</headline>
<dateline>LJUBLJANA 1996-08-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Slovenian Statistical Office reported the following economic indicator details.</p>
<p> SLOVENIAN INFLATION		  Aug   July    Aug 1995</p>
<p> Monthly retail price rise (pct)  +0.1   +0.5    +0.5</p>
<p> Yr/yr rise (pct)		    +10.3  +10.7   +11.0</p>
<p>-- Marja Novak, Ljubljana newsroom, 386-61-125-8439</p>
</text>
